{"data":"<div class=\"rounded bg-white h-100\">\n    <div class=\"container-fluid\">\n        <div class=\"px-3 pt-3\">\n            <div id=\"player\" class=\"d-none\"><\/div>\n            <div class=\"dur\"><\/div>\n            <h1 class=\"m-0 font-weight-600\">[U15-P1]\u30c9\u30ea\u30eb<\/h1>\n                    <\/div>\n        <div class=\"px-3 pt-3\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-gray-f3 p-1 rounded mb-2\">\r\n            <div class=\"row py-1\">\r\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\r\n                <span class=\"mr-2 font-weight-bold\">\r\n                    Deadline:\r\n                <\/span>\r\n                <span id=\"activity-has-deadline\" class=\"\">\r\n                                            12\/09\/2026 23:59:00\r\n                                    <\/span>\r\n                <span id=\"activity-does-not-have-deadline\" class=\" d-none \">\r\n                    Not set\r\n                <\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    \r\n            <div class=\"row py-1\">\r\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\r\n                <span class=\"mr-2 font-weight-bold\">\r\n                    Passing grade:\r\n                <\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"text-success\">\r\n                    4\r\n                <\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    \r\n            <div class=\"row py-1\">\r\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\r\n                <span class=\"mr-2 font-weight-bold\">\r\n                    Max grade:\r\n                <\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"text-info\">\r\n                    10\r\n                <\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    \r\n            <div class=\"row py-1\">\r\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\r\n                <span class=\"mr-2 font-weight-bold\">\r\n                    Achieved grade:\r\n                <\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"text-danger\">\r\n                    0\r\n                <\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"w-100 custom-vh-50 border-file-read rounded d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center\">\r\n    <div class=\"text-window overflow-auto p-2 thin-scrollbar-thumb-route-gray thin-scrollbar-lg w-100 h-100 text-gray-reader ck-content\">\r\n        <p><strong>1. M\u1ee5c ti\u00eau:<\/strong> ph\u1ea7n Drill (luy\u1ec7n t\u1eadp) n\u00e0y gi\u00fap h\u1ecdc vi\u00ean l\u00e0m quen v\u1edbi vi\u1ec7c n\u00f3i ti\u1ebfng Nh\u1eadt tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u00e1m \u0111\u00f4ng; l\u00e0 n\u01a1i \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u00e1o vi\u00ean v\u00e0 c\u00e1c h\u1ecdc vi\u00ean kh\u00e1c c\u00f9ng xem, g\u00f3p \u00fd, trao \u0111\u1ed5i,... v\u1ec1 b\u00e0i luy\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ecdc m\u00e0 m\u00ecnh \u0111\u00e3 chia s\u1ebb nh\u1eb1m c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n v\u00e0 n\u00e2ng cao kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng n\u00f3i c\u1ee7a b\u1ea3n th\u00e2n (v\u1ec1 t\u00e1c phong, s\u1eafc th\u00e1i bi\u1ec3u c\u1ea3m, ph\u00e1t \u00e2m, ng\u1eef \u0111i\u1ec7u,..)<\/p><p><strong>2. H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn:&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p><ul><li><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1:&nbsp;<\/strong>Sinh vi\u00ean tham kh\u1ea3o c\u00e1c t\u00e0i li\u1ec7u \u0111\u00ednh k\u00e8m \u201cH\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn luy\u1ec7n shadowing\u201d, \u201cH\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn luy\u1ec7n ph\u00e1t \u00e2m\u201d<\/li><li><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 2<\/strong>: Sinh vi\u00ean luy\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ecdc shadowing d\u1ef1a theo t\u00e0i li\u1ec7u \u201cH\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn luy\u1ec7n shadowing\u201d&nbsp;<\/li><li><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 3<\/strong>: Sinh vi\u00ean s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i, m\u00e1y t\u00ednh c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n \u0111\u1ec3 thu video qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh luy\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ecdc shadowing.<\/li><li><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 4:&nbsp;<\/strong>N\u1ed9p l\u00ean h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u00e1o vi\u00ean ch\u1ea5m \u0111i\u1ec3m v\u00e0 nh\u1eadn feedback t\u1eeb m\u1ecdi ng\u01b0\u1eddi.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>3. L\u01b0u \u00fd:&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Kh\u00f4ng gian khi quay c\u1ea7n y\u00ean t\u0129nh, h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf t\u1ea1p \u00e2m b\u00ean ngo\u00e0i (ti\u1ebfng qu\u1ea1t, ti\u1ebfng ng\u01b0\u1eddi n\u00f3i chuy\u1ec7n, ti\u1ebfng \u0111\u1ed9ng v\u1eadt\u2026)<\/li><li>B\u00e0i n\u1ed9p c\u1ee7a sinh vi\u00ean s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1ea5p nh\u1eadn n\u1ebfu s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m quay r\u00f5 m\u1eb7t sinh vi\u00ean. Nh\u1eefng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m nh\u01b0: g\u00f3c quay b\u1ecb khu\u1ea5t m\u1eb7t, s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng filter kh\u00f4ng nh\u00ecn th\u1ea5y r\u00f5 kh\u1ea9u h\u00ecnh v\u00e0 bi\u1ec3u c\u1ea3m g\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1eb7t,\u2026 \u0111\u1ec1u kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1ea5p nh\u1eadn.<\/li><li>Tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi up video, c\u1ea7n ki\u1ec3m tra l\u1ea1i ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ee7a video nh\u01b0: \u00e2m thanh ,h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh\u2026 \u0111\u00e3 \u1ed5n ch\u01b0a (c\u00f3 b\u1ecb m\u1ea5t ti\u1ebfng kh\u00f4ng, h\u00ecnh c\u00f3 b\u1ecb nh\u00f2e kh\u00f4ng\u2026).<\/li><li>N\u1ebfu video c\u00f3 dung l\u01b0\u1ee3ng &gt;100Mb th\u00ec sinh vi\u00ean s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 \u0111\u1ec3 l\u00e0m gi\u1ea3m k\u00edch c\u1ee1 video xu\u1ed1ng &lt;100mb, ho\u1eb7c t\u00e1ch ra l\u00e0m nhi\u1ec1u video nh\u1ecf r\u1ed3i m\u1edbi n\u1ed9p b\u00e0i. <i><strong>N\u1ed9p video tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp tr\u00ean h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng, kh\u00f4ng up folder kh\u00e1c r\u1ed3i k\u00e9o link qua.<\/strong><\/i><\/li><\/ul><p><strong>4. \u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh:&nbsp;<\/strong>N\u1ed9p b\u00e0i theo \u0111\u00fang h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn.<\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"pr-3 pt-3\">\r\n        <h3>Guide files<\/h3>\r\n        <div class=\"my-3\">\r\n                            <div class=\"d-flex-not-important align-items-center px-2 bg-white-wannabe-grey rounded mb-1 width-fit-content max-width-100\">\r\n                    <div class=\"file-na